    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>Why does this exist</h1>
    <p class="thesis">Hi, my name is Alan. I was born in Mexico City but grew up in Miami. I recently started a business in Mexico and quickly realized I was oblivious to most of what was happening in the country.</p>
    <p>I wanted a place where I could curate all the news I cared about, and none of the news I didn't. I also felt lost when looking at numbers. Without much context, I couldn't tell if a 6% interest rate was high or low for Mexico.</p>
    <p>So I started Mexico Brief. I began using it religiously, and when a few friends found it helpful, I decided to open it up.</p>
    <p>It refreshes every morning, and I'm always adding new feeds. If you have ideas for how to make it better, let me know.</p>
    <p class="sign">Alan</p>
